From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hannes Janetzek <hannes.janetzek@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 21:35:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add desktop Linux setup and launcher

desktop/setup_desktop.sh builds zyncore (without GPIO) and the zynlibs,
creates a Python venv with uv and the user's config and data directories
from the zynthian-sys templates. desktop/zynthian_desktop.sh runs zynthian
against the desktop's JACK server (PipeWire), regenerating the LV2 cache on
first start. Read-only parts come from the sibling git checkouts (or a
package's ZYNTHIAN_DIR), writable ones go to the XDG directories.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
(cherry picked from commit 590e69b7458a10183dd39ea02d2d8387e0cbc8f5)
